WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:59.134 --> 00:01:00.678
I'm healed...

00:01:00.678 --> 00:01:02.139
Is it because of the snow?

00:01:02.139 --> 00:01:05.124
Yay, Dad's all better!

00:01:05.124 --> 00:01:06.284
Hahaha!

00:01:06.451 --> 00:01:09.325
I can go home... Finally...

00:01:09.325 --> 00:01:10.816
Did the Tsaritsa cure us?

00:01:10.816 --> 00:01:12.345
Thank You, Your Majesty!

00:01:23.147 --> 00:01:28.371
Valo... Mimi zoi...

00:01:32.269 --> 00:01:37.060
I'm sorry. Love cannot cure you of this curse

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:42.837
Rest in peace, my child

